  @task:TASK-RAG05-002
  @boundary
  Scenario: Multiple <think> blocks in the same output are all stripped
    Given the Player produced output containing two separate <think>...</think> blocks
    When the orchestrator prepares the Player output for Coach evaluation
    Then the content sent to the Coach should contain no <think>...</think> block
    And the surviving non-<think> text should appear in its original order

  # Why: Just-inside boundary — empty <think></think> is structurally legal
