  @task:TASK-RAG05-002
  @negative
  Scenario: Malformed (unterminated) <think> tag is handled without data loss
    Given the Player produced output containing an opening <think> tag with no closing tag
    When the orchestrator prepares the Player output for Coach evaluation
    Then the content sent to the Coach should equal the original output unchanged
    And a malformed-think-block warning should be recorded in the session log

