  @task:TASK-RAG05-001
  @edge-case @regression @security
  Scenario: Provider-conditional prompt selection does not affect Coach tool inventory
    Given AGENT_MODELS__REASONING_MODEL is set to "local"
    When the Coach is created for the architect role
    Then the Coach should have zero tools
    And the Coach factory should not accept a tools parameter

  # Why: Stripping integrity — the helper must not corrupt content that
