  @task:TASK-RAG05-001
  @edge-case @regression
  Scenario Outline: All architect modes use the trained prompt when provider is local
    Given AGENT_MODELS__REASONING_MODEL is set to "local"
    When the orchestrator resolves the Player system prompt for the architect role in "<mode>" mode
    Then the resolved prompt should be the GOAL.md-trained architect prompt
    And the resolved prompt should not be the per-mode Phase 0 prompt for "<mode>"

    Examples:
      | mode        |
      | greenfield  |
      | align       |
      | exploration |
      | feasibility |

  # Why: The rejection-revision loop reinjects Coach feedback as a user
  #       message containing the prior Player output (per TASK-REV-R2A1).
  #       After <think> stripping, the feedback that goes back to the
