  @task:TASK-RAG05-002
  @edge-case @regression
  Scenario: Stripped output reinjected on revision still satisfies the message-role contract
    Given the Coach rejected the Player's first output
    And the Player's first output contained a <think>...</think> block
    When the orchestrator constructs the revision input for the Player
